local function F(n)n=n or 0 local u,i={"","K","M","B","T","Qa","Qi"},1
while n>=1000 and i<#u do n=n/1000 i=i+1 end
return i==1 and string.format("%.0f",n) or string.format("%.2f%s",n,u[i])end
local function T(s)local f=math.floor return string.format("%dd %dh %dm %ds",f(s/86400),f(s%86400/3600),f(s%3600/60),f(s%60))end
local function R(n,v)return n..": "..F(v).."/s | "..F(v*60).."/min | "..F(v*3600).."/h | "..F(v*86400).."/d"end

